# --- fuzz decode-corpus (cargo-fuzz / libFuzzer artifacts, binary) ---
# Explicit per-target list (allowlist style): these are fuzzer-GENERATED
# inputs for the *_decode harnesses (hex-hash names, a few KB each —
# verified 2026-10-25: 4427 files, no secrets, no sources). Never
# blanket-ignore real sources: harness code (fuzz/fuzz_targets/*.rs) and
# any future seed files stay tracked.
fuzz/corpus/block_decode/
fuzz/corpus/cert_envelope_decode/
fuzz/corpus/consensus_msg_decode/
fuzz/corpus/evm_raw_tx_decode/
fuzz/corpus/frame_decode/
fuzz/corpus/peer_msg_decode/
fuzz/corpus/transaction_decode/
fuzz/artifacts/
# --- open-source hardening (OS1): never publish secrets or local state ---
*.key
*.pem
keys/
.env*
env.*
*handoff*
*helper*keys*
node_modules/
.opencode/

# --- publish: local runtime/state dirs (never commit) ---
.archive/
artifacts/
run/
tmp/
node-data/
data-store/
chunks/
